WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.801
-Now, Ewan,

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:04.170
you star in the new movie
"Birds of Prey,"

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.706
but, a lot of people might not
know that, back in the '80s,

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:07.940
we were actually
on a show together.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.742
-You're talking
about "Point Pleasant."

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:11.744
-You remember that?
-Of course. Yeah, yeah.

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:12.812
-That's right.
The show was called

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.347
"Point Pleasant
Police Department"

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:16.816
and it took place in lovely
Point Pleasant, New Jersey.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.317
-Right.
[ Cheering ]

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:20.353
-We played two detectives
who couldn't see eye-to-eye

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.054
and we'd get in a lotta
arguments and, yeah.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:23.723
-I mean, I know it sounds
like we're jokin' around,

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.725
but it was really quite
intense drama.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:26.959
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, yeah.
-Intense show.

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:28.594
-The two cops would get
in a lot of arguments

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:30.763
and always seemed to end up
[laughing] in messy situations.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.565
We actually have a clip
from one of the episodes.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.566
-No, you do not.
-I do, yeah.

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:35.234
-You do?
-Take a look.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:38.471
[ Upbeat rock plays ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:44.811
♪♪

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.345
♪♪

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:51.117
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:54.988
-Well, what's poppin', Palmer?

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.989
-Not much, Pete.

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.724
You seem pretty, uh,

00:00:58.724 --> 00:00:59.759
perturbed.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.929
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:06.566
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.300
-Probably 'cause
Lieutenant Porter

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.435
put me on probation.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.871
[ Laughter ]
-Ah!

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.939
All this shall pass, eh, Pete?

00:01:13.939 --> 00:01:16.509
[ Laughter ]
-I repeat --

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.311
[ Laughing ]
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:22.047
[ Laughter ]
[ Sputtering ]

00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:25.318
[ Fresh laughter and applause ]

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:26.852
Let's have a party

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:29.689
in the Point Pleasant

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.524
Police Department, come on!

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:32.691
-Okay.
-Kaplew!

00:01:32.691 --> 00:01:37.096
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:40.333
-Xavier?
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:49.007
♪♪

00:01:49.007 --> 00:01:50.209
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:51.411
-[Laughing]

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:53.546
You know, watching it --
watching it

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:54.914
was even more intense
than I remember.

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:58.150
-Yeah. It's really -- It was
really in-your-face stuff.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.720
-[laughing] Oh! We actually
have another clip.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.123
-No!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:05.758
-Where?
-That was the blooper episode.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.360
-Ah.
-That was the blooper episode.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.495
We actually --
-You got the real deal.

00:02:09.495 --> 00:02:11.230
-We broke and it was
like ridiculous.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.531
Never aired,
so that was a little treat.

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:13.833
But we have another clip.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.635
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.736
In this episode, I think
I have more lines than you.

00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:19.972
[ Laughter ]
[ Clapping ]

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:21.608
Let's take a look at this.

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:24.644
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:31.183
♪♪

00:02:31.183 --> 00:02:34.820
♪♪

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.823
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.857
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.857 --> 00:02:39.992
[ Laughter and cheer ]

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:41.060
-You're late, Palmer!

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.362
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.362 --> 00:02:46.499
Problems parking?

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:47.967
-Precisely.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:51.871
Some punk parked his Prius
in my...place!

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:54.908
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.577 --> 00:02:58.745
-That peeves my pickle!

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:02.548
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:04.783
That's right.
-I prefer the --

00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:06.318
I prefer the pamplemousse.

00:03:06.318 --> 00:03:08.220
-Oh, yeah?
-Pamplemousse!

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.622
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:10.622 --> 00:03:11.624
Know what I'm saying?

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:14.126
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:17.964
-Pamplemousse?
Why don't you try punch?

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:20.299
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:21.934
-Only if you pass the puddin'.

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:23.169
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:24.437
-Well, then --

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:27.040
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.040
-Pudding!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.075
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:30.075 --> 00:03:31.177
Ah, puddin' me!

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:33.278
Ah, puddin'!

00:03:33.278 --> 00:03:34.514
-That one hurt.

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:35.748
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.517
Alright, that was like
a rock, yeah.

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:38.685
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:41.220
You don't want any parfait?

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:42.689
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.490
-I like puddin'!

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.691
How many times
I gotta tell you?

00:03:45.691 --> 00:03:46.959
Puddin'!
-Parfait!

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:48.361
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.263
-Puddin'!

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:53.199
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:03:53.199 --> 00:04:01.140
♪♪

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.743
♪♪

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:07.614
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.981 --> 00:04:10.416
-Good clip.

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:11.884
You can --

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:14.820
[ Laughing helplessly ]

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:17.623
You can really feel
the emotion in that scene.

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:18.924
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.924 --> 00:04:20.726
Even after all these years,
I can almost taste it.

00:04:20.726 --> 00:04:24.731
-Yeah?
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:27.733
What's that?

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:29.134
We have one more clip?
-No.

00:04:29.134 --> 00:04:30.469
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:30.469 --> 00:04:32.504
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:32.504 --> 00:04:33.773
We have one more clip.

00:04:33.773 --> 00:04:35.407
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.407 --> 00:04:36.876
I put this on to remember.

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:38.311
-Oh, just to remind yourself.

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:40.612
-I didn't see --
You didn't recognize it.

00:04:40.612 --> 00:04:42.348
You didn't see it.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:43.649
We really have one more clip?

00:04:43.649 --> 00:04:45.952
Alright, man.
This one, [laughs]

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:47.086
the tension really comes
to a boil

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:48.488
and things get outta control.

00:04:48.488 --> 00:04:49.989
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, in this one?

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:52.258
-In this one, yeah.
Check it out.

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:54.593
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:04:54.593 --> 00:05:04.003
♪♪

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:06.005
♪♪

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.073
-Proud of ya, Pete!

00:05:07.073 --> 00:05:08.373
[ Laughter ]

00:05:08.373 --> 00:05:09.609
The way you pinpointed

00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:12.779
Point Pleasant's
most prolific predator.

00:05:12.779 --> 00:05:15.681
Are you pleased?

00:05:15.681 --> 00:05:19.184
-I'm more peppy
than a porcupine in a puddle.

00:05:19.184 --> 00:05:22.922
-Pardon the pun,
but perhaps we should

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:25.424
pig out!
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.424 --> 00:05:28.528
[ Applause ]

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:29.862
-Well.
-What do you think?

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:32.398
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.398 --> 00:05:36.369
-Perhaps some pecan pie!

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:40.039
-Ah!
No, I prefer the peach pie!

00:05:40.039 --> 00:05:41.673
[ Laughter ]

00:05:41.673 --> 00:05:45.311
-How about

00:05:45.311 --> 00:05:47.112
pomegranate pie?!

00:05:47.112 --> 00:05:48.814
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, my God.

00:05:48.814 --> 00:05:50.883
Pretty good, Pete.
-Yeah, thanks.

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:52.985
-Yeah, but there's
an important piece missin'

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.787
to this pie puzzle.

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:55.855
-Yeah, what's that?

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.757
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.757 --> 00:05:59.192
[ Hissing ]

00:05:59.192 --> 00:06:00.492
-Oh. Hang on.
-Yeah.

00:06:00.492 --> 00:06:02.628
-[Mumbling]
-Yeah.

00:06:02.628 --> 00:06:04.697
[ Laughter ]
No. Oh, you're gettin' high.

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:06.064
He's getting -- no, no, no.

00:06:06.064 --> 00:06:07.567
[ Laughter ]
No.
-Perfect.

00:06:07.567 --> 00:06:08.835
-Okay.

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:11.804
[ Laughter ]

00:06:15.608 --> 00:06:17.510
Perfect!
[ Laughter ]

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.645
-Well put, partner.
I'm glad we took part

00:06:19.645 --> 00:06:22.214
in the Point Pleasant
Police Department.

00:06:22.214 --> 00:06:23.449
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:25.785
[ Whistling ]
♪♪

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:32.691
♪♪

00:06:32.691 --> 00:06:34.293
[ Whistling ]
-What a show.

00:06:34.293 --> 00:06:36.662
[ Cheering and applause ]
Wow.

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:39.232
What a show!
-What a show.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:40.733
[ Laughter ]

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:42.835
-What a show that was.
-Wow.

00:06:42.835 --> 00:06:44.703
They should bring it back.
-They should bring it back.

00:06:44.703 --> 00:06:45.905
My thanks to Ewan McGregor,
everyone.

